const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文建立小型开放经济动态模型，用以匹配宏观波动中的主要经验规律，包括贸易余额行为。 阅读时应将其放回原始样本、时点和制度环境中理解，不能把问题本身当作跨市场结论。",en:"The article develops a dynamic small-open-economy model intended to match key empirical regularities of macroeconomic fluctuations, including trade-balance behavior. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/0014-2921(94)00105-9",label:{zh:"European Economic Review · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"European Economic Review · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"它将模型含义与总体周期矩比较，偏好设定、外部环境、校准、会计恒等式和国家统计口径均属于分析内容。 比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系共同构成研究合同；改变其中任一选择，可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It compares model implications with aggregate cyclical moments, so preference specification, external environment, calibration, accounting identities, and country measurement choices are part of the analysis. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/0014-2921(94)00105-9",label:{zh:"European Economic Review · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"European Economic Review · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"实证对应需要带日期的国民账户、产出、消费、投资、贸易余额、价格、世界利率、人口和季调惯例，并保留数据版本和修订记录。 字段定义、可得时点和样本筛选必须与原研究分开记录，不能因变量同名或使用最新修订值便视为可比。",en:"An empirical counterpart needs dated national accounts, output, consumption, investment, trade balance, prices, world interest rates, population and seasonal-adjustment conventions, plus data-vintage and revision records. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/0014-2921(94)00105-9",label:{zh:"European Economic Review · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"European Economic Review · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"论文对特定开放经济规律提供模型化解释，不会识别实时冲击、预测一国周期或证明某项政策效果。 它只支持来源描述的经验或理论关系，不能把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"The paper provides a modeled explanation for selected open-economy regularities; it does not identify a live shock, forecast a country's cycle, or establish one policy effect. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not turn association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/0014-2921(94)00105-9",label:{zh:"European Economic Review · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"European Economic Review · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"保留国民账户版本和发布时间；声明国家与币种定义；记录去趋势和季调；列出校准参数；区分模型矩与观测因果估计。 开展后续分析前，应将这些选择写入版本化研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Preserve national-account vintages and release dates; state country and currency definitions; document detrending and seasonal adjustment; list calibrated parameters; and distinguish model moments from observed causal estimates. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/0014-2921(94)00105-9",label:{zh:"European Economic Review · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"European Economic Review · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 European Economic Review · DOI record。风格化小型开放经济模型不是当前宏观预测、政策处方或替代国别制度分析。 如需数值结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites European Economic Review · DOI record. A stylized small-open-economy model is not a current macro forecast, policy prescription, or substitute for country-specific institutional analysis. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/0014-2921(94)00105-9",label:{zh:"European Economic Review · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"European Economic Review · DOI record · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Business Cycles in a Small Open Economy”公开说明的研究对象、设计与适用边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。风格化小型开放经济模型不是当前宏观预测、政策处方或替代国别制度分析。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Business Cycles in a Small Open Economy”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
